  "description": "These 6.5\" YITAMOTOR Running Boards perfectly fit the 2015-2025 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab. They are made of high-quality stainless steel, with a 450lbs weight capacity for each side. Plus, they are finished with a powder coat, corrosion-resistant.\nFitment\n- for 2015-2026 Chevy Colorado Crew Cab\n- for 2015-2026 GMC Canyon Crew Cab\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2015-2026 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab with 4 full-size doors. Please check the Cab Size picture before ordering\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6.5\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent performance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
